content.text:
The investigation points to one fault in ts-preserve-service, with its effect reaching ts-ui-dashboard. The evidence below comes from the queries I ran.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_aborted",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name='POST' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4",
          "claim": "All 242 preserve POST client calls to travel failed with Error status and no HTTP response code."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name, c.span_name, c.attr_status_code, c.attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, round(quantile_cont(c.duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND p.span_name='POST' AND p.attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4",
          "claim": "Travel's trip_detail server spans under the failing preserve POSTs still return 200 with normal timing; the cut happens after travel answers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT message FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND level='SEVERE' LIMIT 2",
          "claim": "Preserve logs SEVERE: I/O error on POST to ts-travel-service trip_detail, 'Unexpected end of file from server'."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4",
          "claim": "Preserve's own server spans for preserve return 500 with Error status, 242 times, versus no errors in normal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code code, count(*) n, round(quantile_cont(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 10",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's POST /api/v1/preserveservice/preserve spans return 500 with Error, p50 about 6.8s, as preserve's failures surface to the user."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
